%% UC-06 — Complete questionnaire
%% Also entered directly (bypassing the list below) as the post-donation questionnaire
%% from UC-03: F navigates straight to /questionnaire/:slug?habitUuid=:uuid.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant N4 as Neo4j

    P->>F: Open My Profile > Health Questionnaires
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/participant/questionnaires
    B->>M: Resolve study enrollment -> assigned questionnaires
    M-->>B: questionnaire definitions (scope: study | habit)
    B->>M: getQuestionnaireCompletionStatus: for every returned slug,<br/>find questionnaire_windows for this user (earliest open one →<br/>available/nextDueAt, latest closed one → completedAt)
    Note over B,M: Study-scoped definitions are always listed once assigned.<br/>A habit-scoped one (e.g. an admin-defined check-in, see UC-20) is only<br/>listed once the participant has an actual window for it — i.e. has already<br/>created a relevant habit (see UC-35). SRHI itself never appears here at<br/>all: it's unconditional and has no `questionnaires` collection entry —<br/>it lives only in My Habits (UC-13).
    B-->>F: questionnaires + {available, completedAt, nextDueAt} per slug
    F->>F: available=true -> green, tappable button<br/>available=false -> greyed-out tile, non-interactive,<br/>showing "Completed on {completedAt}" (or "Not yet available")
    P->>F: Tap an available questionnaire, answer questions, submit
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/questionnaire-responses<br/>{questionnaireSlug, answers, habitUuid?}
    alt habitUuid supplied (post-donation entry from UC-03)
        B->>M: Verify a matching, not-yet-answered<br/>habit_donations record exists for this user+slug
        Note over B,M: A valid match always bypasses the window-due<br/>check below outright — it's a one-off ad-hoc fill by<br/>construction. An invalid/reused habitUuid instead<br/>falls through to the normal gated path.
    else no habitUuid
        B->>M: getQuestionnaireCompletionStatus for this one slug
        alt slug has a window AND it's not currently available
            B-->>F: 409 — already completed / next occurrence not due yet
            F->>F: Show "already completed" error (handles a stale cache/race,<br/>since the UI already hides this case)
        end
    end
    alt not rejected with 409 above
        B->>B: Validate answers against question schema
        B->>M: insert(form_responses {..., habitUuid?})
        B->>M: markWindowSubmitted: close the earliest open window,<br/>stamp submittedAt + link responseId (best-effort — logged, not fatal)
        opt habitUuid was verified above
            B->>M: set habit_donations.questionnaireResponseId
        end
        B->>N4: Link response metadata to participant graph (where applicable)
        B-->>F: 201 response recorded
        F->>F: Invalidate participantQuestionnairesProvider +<br/>dueQuestionnairesProvider — this item greys out immediately,<br/>without waiting for a restart. Answers can't be changed after this —<br/>the tile turns green again once the next occurrence's window is due.
        F-->>P: Navigate to confirmation screen (carries habitUuid, if any,<br/>as a query param on the confirmation route)
        alt habitUuid present (post-donation entry from UC-03)
            F-->>P: CTA reads "Share Another Habit" — taps go to /share
        else no habitUuid (general/scheduled questionnaire)
            F-->>P: CTA reads "Back to Profile" — taps go to /settings/profile
        end
    end
